Today I have uploaded a separate module for Parallel with Lojban pronunciation.

This module features:
- 26 sentences
- all vowels, including the mysterious {y}
- all consonants, including {'}
- examples of various consonant clusters which may be difficult to native English speakers
- Better sound quality than in standard Parallel modules


